    "updated_at": "2018-06-28T21:24:30Z",
    "body": "Hmm. I'm having trouble understanding what's unclear about the specification here, although I'm far from an expert in these areas, and the fact that you've found an interop problem is worth investigating in and of itself.\r\n\r\nAs far as I can tell, the UA requirements on bdo and dir are entirely contained in the rendering section, specifically the UA stylesheet for [bidirectional text](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/rendering.html#bidi-rendering).\r\n\r\nFrom what I can see adding dir=\"auto\" is the same as adding dir=\"asdf\"; there are no rules in that section that apply to either dir=\"auto\" or dir=\"asdf\". Is that your reading too?",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
