    "body": "> the authoring requirement that \"auto must not be used\" doesn't impose any rendering requirement on UAs,\r\n\r\nYes, that's what I was saying in all my previous comments... I'm sorry if that wasn't clear. See especially my first comment: https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/3782#issuecomment-401178039 which I thought you agreed with.\r\n\r\n> nothing else requires bdo to be handled differently from other elements with regard to dir-attribute handling\r\n\r\nI'm not sure that's correct. https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/rendering.html#bidi-rendering seems to have specific rules for bdo.",
