    "updated_at": "2018-07-01T02:54:40Z",
    "body": "No, the reason I drew that equivalence is not because of the irrelevant authoring requirement. It's because the UA rendering rules specify nothing, for either dir=auto or for dir=asdf, besides the bdo[dir] rule.",
