    "created_at": "2018-07-02T19:21:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-07-02T19:21:11Z",
    "body": "What about `bdo` with `dir=asdf` or any other \"junk\" value -- how should browsers render that?\r\n\r\nWhat about `bdo` without any `dir` attribute? Does the spec make it clear what to do in this case?",
