    "created_at": "2018-08-15T14:58:15Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-08-15T14:58:15Z",
    "body": "Wouldn't it make sense to add a sentence to the spec to clarify the expected behaviour, given that we have three incompatible interpretations of the spec intent so far?",
    "author_association": "NONE",
