    "updated_at": "2018-08-15T15:01:12Z",
    "body": "I think our best effort in that direction is web platform tests and browser bugs. The spec is fairly clear, if a bit spread out. There's also the persistent problem where browser vendors are interpreting authoring guidance as having some impact on implementation, but that's a much larger issue, that we shouldn't tackle in a one-off fashion.",
